  "text": "₠\n\n.AnchorStyles:\n첫 번째는 각각의 수식이 어떤 성질인지 알아야 합니다. 두 번째는 시퀀스가 소프트로고 아니고 더 쉬운 방법을 찾아야 합니까. 그리고 세 번째는 인수의 값이 1/2에 도달하기는 안 되더군요.\n\nLet's see if we can simplify the given expression. We know that \\(\\sin^2(x) + \\cos^2(x) = 1\\). Let's abbreviate this as \\(a(x) = \\sin^2(x) + \\cos^2(x)\\).\n\nNow, the given product is:\n\\[\n\\prod_{k=0}^n a(2^k)\n\\]\nand we want the expression to be \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\).\n\nGiven this, we test few values of \\((2^k)\\) and see if the product converges to required value. When \\((2^k)\\) is 2, for example: \n\\[\na(2) = \\sin^2(2) + \\cos^2(2) = 1\n\\]\nand thus adding this one term turns current product 1. The next product is:\n\\[\n\\prod_{k=0}^n a(2^n + 2^{n+1}) = \\prod_{k=0}^n (1)\n\\]\nBut in general, instead of directly calculating the second term \\(\\prod_{k=0}^n a(2^{n+k})\\), we notice it gets multiplied sequentially and should perhaps reflect our terms concievably (\\sin^2x + cos^2x).\n\n為了使題得完成，我們 :\n找最小的正整數\\( n \\)，當哪末 乘積:\n\\( \\left( \\sin^2(1) + \\cos^2(2) \\right) \\cdot \\left( \\sin^2(2) + \\cos^2(4) \\right) \\cdot \\ldots  \\cdot \\left( \\sin^2(2^n) + \\cos^2(2^{n+1}) \\right) = \\frac{1}{2} \\)。 \n\n考虑这个乘积的定义：它是由一系列的乘积组成，每个乘积是两侧为单位常数 \\(\\sin^2{2^k} + \\cos^2{2^{k+1}}\\) 如上这些乘积的所有结果相乘等于 \\(\\frac{1}{2} 极积x\"style=\"text-align:right;\"\"\"\n\nroke推出的。 现在我们知道乘积 简化到每个数量1，但考虑这个题目的条件，我们一看是没人去计算更多結果，所以 $ n = 1 $ 是那正确答案。\n\n综上所述，按照题需要，\nsmall n equal\n\\[\n\\boxed{1}\n\\]\n到最正确的歩的方法去考虑。\n\n用户悦",
